Z||000000||truxpin||11-30-2001||09:23 PM||||Been doing a little investigating into recall work on my '87 GT . I called Pontiac (1-800-PMCARES) to see if they could tell me if any recalls have been performed on my car. They called me back 2 days later only to tell me that their records of VIN #'s don't go back that far???  They want me to go to a dealer and have them check to see if recall work was done or not. Personally I don't trust ANY dealership to tell me anything honestly, especially when it comes to recall work. <BR>Is Pontiac feeding me ****  about their records? Any way I can check to see if front manifold recall was ever performed ? ( what to look for ? ) <BR>||||reg||5
